* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Sources
V1 1 0 DC v1
V2 3 0 DC v2

* Resistors
R1 1 2 R
R2 3 2 R
R3 4 0 10R
R4 2 0 10R
RF 2 5 10R

* Operational Amplifier
XOPAMP 0 2 5 OPAMP

* (Note: OPAMP is assumed to be an ideal component. It needs to be defined in the library or replaced by an equivalent model.)